 drivers/phy/mediatek/Makefile            |   1 +
 drivers/phy/mediatek/phy-mtk-pcie-sphy.c | 556 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 566 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/phy/mediatek/phy-mtk-pcie-sphy.c

